    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chu Du states that Limitless Demon Venerable refined the legendary derivation Gu, hid inside Crazed Demon Cave in his later years, and ran experiments and Gu refinements on it while pursuing eternal life. Not Immortal’s will confirms that derivation Gu sits at the deepest layer, surrounded by a huge super Gu formation.",
        "chapters": [
          1176
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-concealment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chu_du",
          "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
          "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
          "char_not_immortal",
          "sys_super_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Not Immortal answers Fang Yuan’s guess that Limitless meant to remake humanity: Ren Zu’s creation of humanity is an unparalleled human path method, while Limitless cultivated rule path and wanted to use derivation Gu to derive new dao marks as clues toward eternal life. The Three Crazed Demon Eccentrics aim to reach the formation’s core, control derivation Gu, and make the formation work for them.",
        "chapters": [
          1176
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-concealment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_three_crazed_demon_eccentrics"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later calls derivation Gu a rank nine Immortal Gu and judges that even obtaining it would be a huge burden, comparing that problem to Wisdom Gu. He also notes it remains at the bottom layer under the Eccentrics’ guard.",
        "chapters": [
          1189
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-concealment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_wisdom_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Still later he wonders whether prior venerables went on to the ninth layer, and if they did, why they did not destroy the formation and take away the rank nine derivation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1867
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-concealment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "During the later fight he wonders whether the derivation Gu from The Legends of Ren Zu and Limitless Demon Venerable’s study of eternal life sit at the center of the orbiting rank nine formation.",
        "chapters": [
          2187
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-concealment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
