  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Tie Ruo Nan retells the ending while arguing about ten extreme physiques: Ren Zu’s ten children die one by one, Ren Zu nears death by old age, gathers their corpses, and sacrifices himself with them into Derivation Gu. Its stomach bursts, spreading life across the land and creating the first batch of mortals, who lack Ren Zu and the ten children’s talent but can cultivate after awakening an aperture. She labels that account a mythological story.",
        "chapters": [
          181
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_ruo_nan",
          "char_ren_zu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later reading of The Legends of Ren Zu restates Ren Zu retrieving his ten children’s corpses and sacrificing himself into derivation Gu’s stomach. Large amounts of dream realms follow the smell of the food into its mouth as well. Its stomach bursts, and light of life creates the first batch of mortals.",
        "chapters": [
          730
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dream-realm-detail",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable names rank nine derivation Immortal Gu as hers and plans to use it for human path development.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-retrieval",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the battle in Crazed Demon Cave she takes a piece of truthful floating ice that contains derivation Gu, uses Heavenly Court’s heaven path research to unseal it, and retrieves the Gu. She then makes rank nine derivation Immortal Gu the main core of a derivation formation meant to develop human path. It is a legendary Immortal Gu first recorded in The Legends of Ren Zu, once obtained by Limitless Demon Venerable and used as the core of his Crazed Demon formation.",
        "chapters": [
          2274
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-retrieval",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "sys_crazed_demon_formation"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
